# Build-time flags for this repo. Each Netlify site sets its own env (netlify.toml); this file is documentation
# and a local template, never deployed configuration. Copy to .env.local to try a flag locally.

# Tenant storefront facets (MP-36). Exactly "on" renders the Make / Type / Daily-rate rows and the phone
# "Filters & sort" sheet in components/browse/FilterBar.tsx on /{team} storefronts. Absent, empty or any other
# value (the default on both Netlify sites) hides them and keeps the Dates row and the inline Sort row. Read
# once at build time (NEXT_PUBLIC_*), so a change needs a rebuild; no Netlify env change is needed for hidden.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_STOREFRONT_FACETS=on
